# Plugin user config — contains credentials, never commit
.claude/*.local.md

# Agent worktree snapshots — local scratch state, not repo history
.claude/worktrees/

# Test run artifacts (E2E outputs, scan reports)
tests/output/
tests/apps/ChapterApps/
